WEBVTT

00:00:00.608 --> 00:00:02.120
Good tools fit us.

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.840
A pen gets a grip.

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.320
A hammer gets a handle.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.960
A chair gets a backrest, armrests, wheels!

00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:11.600
We keep shaping tools around the people who

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:12.160
use them.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.993
So why does software so often work the other

00:00:15.053 --> 00:00:16.113
way around?

00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:17.233
Pick an app.

00:00:17.286 --> 00:00:18.633
Learn its menus.

00:00:18.689 --> 00:00:20.273
Bend your workflow to fit.

00:00:20.373 --> 00:00:22.193
And when your needs change...

00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:22.993
start again.

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.947
What if your tools could change with you?

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:27.507
That's Tabletop.

00:00:27.551 --> 00:00:28.827
Describe what you need.

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:29.947
Review the change.

00:00:29.997 --> 00:00:32.507
Put it to work, right on the canvas.

00:00:32.563 --> 00:00:33.907
Then keep shaping it.

00:00:34.703 --> 00:00:35.927
Let's start small.

00:00:36.087 --> 00:00:37.327
A coffee stand.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:39.847
Type: Make me a sales table for coffee and

00:00:39.927 --> 00:00:40.687
cake.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.287
Review the draft, apply it, and you're ready

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.647
to log sales.

00:00:45.971 --> 00:00:47.047
Now the rush hits.

00:00:47.187 --> 00:00:49.687
Typing every sale is slowing you down.

00:00:49.954 --> 00:00:52.407
So you ask for quick-sale buttons.

00:00:53.931 --> 00:00:54.093
Review.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.053
Apply.

00:00:55.106 --> 00:00:56.413
Click Coffee...

00:00:56.461 --> 00:00:58.813
four coffees, and the total updates.

00:00:58.909 --> 00:00:59.773
Same table.

00:00:59.885 --> 00:01:00.813
Less work.

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:03.153
What's selling?

00:01:03.223 --> 00:01:04.193
Add a chart.

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:06.633
Review it, apply it, and it reads the sales

00:01:06.673 --> 00:01:07.353
already here.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:08.713
No copying.

00:01:08.766 --> 00:01:09.913
No starting over.

00:01:11.177 --> 00:01:12.873
Time for an afternoon offer.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:15.233
Add a ten-percent discount.

00:01:15.296 --> 00:01:16.873
Review, apply...

00:01:16.926 --> 00:01:19.113
gross stays at two hundred and fifty.

00:01:19.193 --> 00:01:21.353
Net: two hundred and twenty-five.

00:01:22.862 --> 00:01:23.347
Actually...

00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:24.787
make that twenty percent.

00:01:24.947 --> 00:01:28.387
Select the rule, ask for the change, and check

00:01:28.427 --> 00:01:29.347
the preview.

00:01:29.454 --> 00:01:30.067
Apply.

00:01:30.227 --> 00:01:31.907
Net: two hundred.

00:01:31.987 --> 00:01:34.467
The table, buttons, and chart stay put.

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:37.047
Start with what you need.

00:01:37.137 --> 00:01:37.727
Use it.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:38.687
Change it.

00:01:38.799 --> 00:01:39.727
Keep going.

00:01:39.874 --> 00:01:41.167
Tabletop.

00:01:41.247 --> 00:01:43.007
Tools that adapt to you.
